imposibleng makagalaw habang fully load.

751
00:40:13.869 --> 00:40:16.038
Idiskarga muna natin ang mga sandbag
at bigyan ito ng isang shot.

752
00:40:16.122 --> 00:40:17.456
Kung hindi ito maputol,

753
00:40:17.540 --> 00:40:20.626
