757
00:40:29.260 --> 00:40:30.928
-Isa, dalawa, tatlo! Pumunta ka, Japan!
-Pumunta ka, Japan!

758
00:40:35.933 --> 00:40:37.309
Ang ikalimang quest.

759
00:40:37.393 --> 00:40:38.811
Ang pananakop ng kastilyo.

760
00:40:39.812 --> 00:40:40.813
Stand by.

761
00:40:43.524 --> 00:40:47.319
Palagi kaming bumabalik ng malakas
upang kunin ang panalo,

762
00:40:47.403 --> 00:40:51.240
