Kailangan lang natin itong i-over the line!

973
00:52:53.336 --> 00:52:54.754
Isa, dalawa!

974
00:52:56.172 --> 00:52:57.465
Kaya natin to!

975
00:53:05.432 --> 00:53:06.766
Kaya natin to!

976
00:53:10.854 --> 00:53:12.147
-Sige!
-Na-clear na namin!

